      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is the the retimer considered another mux? If so, is there a specific index orderinng (e.g retimer is 0, mux is 1) which is assumed?\n\nI know in b/208882941#comment5 we mentioned an assumption of programming the retimer before the mux.",
