      "writtenOn": "2022-06-03T19:54:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For the purposes of the host commands, I was thinking we\u0027ll treat every entry in the mux chain agnostic of whether it\u0027s a retimer or a mux.  And then the next host command I\u0027m working on is the one to return the chip details to you, so you\u0027ll know which index is which for the board.  But the HC and the events are named to be generic for now",
